sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant FE as Frontend (Chat UI)
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant OR as ML Orchestrator<br/>(sentiment + crisis check)
    participant QB as Question Bank
    participant AN as Text/Voice Analysis<br/>+ Fusion + Explanation
    participant DL as Data Layer<br/>(encrypted DB, Storage, Session Store)

    U->>FE: Open app
    FE->>BE: Login / Register request (credentials)
    BE->>BE: Validate credentials & generate custom JWT (Access/Refresh)
    BE->>DL: Check for draft session
    DL-->>BE: Draft found / none
    BE-->>FE: Authenticated (JWTs) + resume/start choice

    alt Draft session exists
        FE-->>U: Show "Resume Draft" banner
        U->>FE: Choose resume or start fresh
    end

    FE-->>U: Show consent screen (first time only)
    U->>FE: Accept and begin

    loop Until conversation complete
        FE->>BE: Turn reply (text or audio)
        BE->>BE: Server-side validation
        BE->>OR: Forward turn
        OR->>OR: Score turn sentiment (fast model)
        OR->>OR: Check crisis keywords/patterns

        alt Risk detected
            OR-->>BE: Risk flag
            BE-->>FE: Immediate crisis resources
            FE-->>U: Show Crisis Resource Panel
            Note over FE,U: Flow interrupts here —<br/>conversation paused, not lost
        else No risk
            OR->>QB: Read theme/phrasing variant<br/>(based on sentiment trend)
            QB-->>OR: Next question
            OR->>DL: Encrypt and store turn<br/>(audio + updated session state)
            OR-->>BE: Next question
            BE-->>FE: Next question
            FE-->>U: Show next question
        end
    end

    BE->>DL: Mark session complete,<br/>fetch full transcript + audio refs
    DL-->>BE: Full transcript + audio

    par Text analysis
        BE->>AN: Analyze full text
        AN-->>BE: text_score + top signals
    and Voice analysis
        BE->>AN: Analyze full voice (librosa features)
        AN-->>BE: voice_score + top signals
    end

    BE->>AN: Fuse scores → severity
    AN-->>BE: severity + probability
    BE->>AN: Generate explanation
    AN-->>BE: plain-language explanation

    BE->>DL: Encrypt and store assessment<br/>(score, severity, explanation, model_version)
    DL-->>BE: Stored

    BE-->>FE: Final results
    FE-->>U: Show Results Dashboard

    alt Severity = High
        FE-->>U: Show Crisis Resource Panel
    end
